      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Respondent Palomar-Santiago, a Mexican national living in the United States, was convicted in California state court of felony DUI in 1988."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2020-20-437",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "1faec98fee6a72194cbb4d76cda220d615b520c36de727728fc8f6389577a812",
      "evidence_id": "ev-1faec98fee6a-0000-0001",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 2,
        "start": 2
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "At the time, lower courts understood that conviction to be an \u201caggravated felony\u201d subjecting a noncitizen to removal from the United States. 8 U. S. C. \u00a7 1227(a)(2)(A)(iii)."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2020-20-437",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "1faec98fee6a72194cbb4d76cda220d615b520c36de727728fc8f6389577a812",
      "evidence_id": "ev-1faec98fee6a-0000-0002",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 2,
        "start": 2
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Palomar-Santiago was removed following a hearing before an immigration judge and a waiver of his right to appeal."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2020-20-437",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "1faec98fee6a72194cbb4d76cda220d615b520c36de727728fc8f6389577a812",
      "evidence_id": "ev-1faec98fee6a-0000-0003",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 2,
        "start": 2
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "In 2017, Palomar-Santiago was found in the United States and indicted on one count of unlawful reentry after removal. See \u00a7 1326(a)."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2020-20-437",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "1faec98fee6a72194cbb4d76cda220d615b520c36de727728fc8f6389577a812",
      "evidence_id": "ev-1faec98fee6a-0000-0005",
      "kind": "holding",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 10,
        "start": 10
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The judgment of the Court of Appeals for the Ninth Circuit is reversed, and the case is remanded for further proceedings consistent with this opinion."
    }
  ],
  "schema_version": "1.0.0"
}
